{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<div class=\"text_box\">\n<div>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">旺角太平道5號住宅單位起火，救出兩名傷者，其中一人昏迷。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-26T03:19:55.106633+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":28,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"unknown"}}